		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2011ca6a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="2011ca6a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-11eff927 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="11eff927" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6e0db7eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6e0db7eb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why a cosmetics brand <span class="hl">sells distribution, not a service menu</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-62d2f96f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="62d2f96f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-33301d65 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="33301d65" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-480da543 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="480da543" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A salon has one calendar. Your product exists on a website, two marketplaces, a shelf and a creator&#8217;s feed simultaneously — each with its own algorithm and margin, and treating them as one channel undersells all of them.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7e8df0d4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7e8df0d4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Swatch content is the strategy</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1f0a030e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1f0a030e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Cosmetics decisions are visual and influencer-led. Studio-only product shots without swatch and UGC content leave the category&#8217;s biggest content advantage unused.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8a8f562 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8a8f562" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Compliance shapes what you can say</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-38fc65f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="38fc65f4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Product registration and claims substantiation aren&#8217;t legal footnotes — they decide what your ads and listings are even allowed to claim, and unsupported claims can get ads rejected or listings pulled. That applies equally to <a href="/google-ads-for-beauty/">Google Shopping campaigns</a> and to <a href="/instagram-facebook-ads-for-beauty/">Instagram and Facebook ads for beauty brands</a>.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6769fb74 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6769fb74" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e5fe4f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e5fe4f7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Cosmetic &amp; makeup brands, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">6 channels</b><span>— D2C, Amazon, Noon, retail, influencer, social commerce</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">D2C margin</b><span>— no marketplace fee on direct sales</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Claims-aware</b><span>— marketing matched to product registration</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">UGC-first</b><span>— swatch content shows what studio shots can&#8217;t</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
